      "content": "thanks, that's good to hear. i was getting a little worried. it's been a bit dull lately, but the redness is actually creeping up towards my knee now and the skin feels really tight, almost like it's being stretched too far. i also feel kind of lightheaded when i stand up... do u think i should try some extra ibuprofen or something else at home to help it go down? i really dont want to deal with a clinic visit if i can just manage it here.",
