      "content": "thanks, i'll try the extra ibuprofen and more water. but it's getting kind of scary now... the pain is turning into this really sharp, throbbing feeling and i actually feel pretty winded just sitting here, like i can't catch my breath properly. my heart is also racing like i just ran a marathon. i'm so anxious about the hospital bills, is there really no way to just wait until tomorrow? i feel like if i just rest and keep the meds going, this will just pass like the swelling did.",
